Vita (--vita-fast-rnd=off|on|verify): cM_rnd and cM_rnd2 (the game's two random generators) end
with fabsf(fmodf(v, 1.0)), a libm call on the Vita. fmodf is exact: for |v| < 1 it returns v, for
1 <= |v| < 2^23 it returns v - trunc(v), which one float subtraction gives exactly (the difference
is representable), and fabsf drops the sign fmodf keeps; the generator's sums are below 3. Larger
values, infinities and NaN keep the call. Same values bit for bit; verify computes both and counts
any difference. Off (0) unless the Vita entry selects it. Also the second generator's state for
0041's verify.

--- a/src/SSystem/SComponent/c_math.cpp
+++ b/src/SSystem/SComponent/c_math.cpp
